rue,"extraction_method":"site_mining_v1","snapshot":6}],"summary":{"text":"KONGSBYGG AS is a private limited company (Aksjeselskap) registered in Enhetsregisteret on 2018-08-21, operating in building construction (Oppføring av bygninger) from Hvitveisbakken 33, 2208 KONGSVINGER. Its registered activities include carpentry, building construction and maintenance, joinery, installation of doors, windows and kitchens, and engineering and project management services for construction projects. For the 2025 financial year, the latest filed accounts, sales revenue was 6566724.00 NOK, the operating result was 51725.00 NOK, and total equity was -69328.00 NOK, with the accounts not audited. Daglig leder is Eivind Soltvedt, the board chair is Jeanne Sally Bjarkøy, and Eivind Soltvedt is also a board member as of 2026-02-05. The company's registered workplace is in KONGSVINGER, and it was not part of a group according to the register. The company was formerly named SOLTVEDT BYGG AS, and its name changed to KONGSBYGG AS on 2022-09-12. A registry update dated 2026-08-11 changed the employee count registration date to 2026-08-11 in Enhetsregisteret, and the company's latest filed accounts year was updated to 2025 on 2026-03-26.","sentences":[{"text":"KONGSBYGG AS is a private limited company (Aksjeselskap) registered in Enhetsregisteret on 2018-08-21, operating in building construction (Oppføring av bygninger) from Hvitveisbakken 33, 2208 KONGSVINGER.","claim_ids":["c3","c4","c5","c7"]},{"text":"Its registered activities include carpentry, building construction and maintenance, joinery, installation of doors, windows and kitchens, and engineering and project management services for construction projects.","claim_ids":["c10"]},{"text":"For the 2025 financial year, the latest filed accounts, sales revenue was 6566724.00 NOK, the operating result was 51725.00 NOK, and total equity was -69328.00 NOK, with the accounts not audited.","claim_ids":["c53","c54","c60","c62"]},{"text":"Daglig leder is Eivind Soltvedt, the board chair is Jeanne Sally Bjarkøy, and Eivind Soltvedt is also a board member as of 2026-02-05.","claim_ids":["c25","c26","c27"]},{"text":"The company's registered workplace is in KONGSVINGER, and it was not part of a group according to the register.","claim_ids":["c29","c24"]},{"text":"The company was formerly named SOLTVEDT BYGG AS, and its name changed to KONGSBYGG AS on 2022-09-12.","claim_ids":["c22"]},{"text":"A registry update dated 2026-08-11 changed the employee count registration date to 2026-08-11 in Enhetsregisteret, and the company's latest filed accounts year was updated to 2025 on 2026-03-26.","claim_ids":["c63","c64"]}],"unknowns":["Open positions (NAV): No active NAV job ad names this organisation number as employer (index built 2026-10-17T09:08:11+00:00).","Dated news: none found on the verified website."],"writer":"model:claude-haiku-5-5"},"changes":[],"refresh":{"previous_run_id":null,"compared_at":"2026-10-17T09:45:27Z"},"errors":[],"operations":{"requests":8,"runtime_ms":7513,"third_party_cost_usd":0,"llm_calls":1},"snapshots":[{"source_url":"https://data.brreg.no/enhetsregisteret/api/enheter/921270887","retrieved_at":"2026-10-17T09:43:16Z","content_sha256":"07d62f8994f8745eafd8e27b64e9315ec40bd299b61e657aaacbdb7212ee2a8c","snapshot_path":"snapshots/07/07d62f8994f8745eafd8e27b64e9315ec40bd299b61e657aaacbdb7212ee2a8c.json","source_class":"official_registry","licence":"NLOD 2.0 (Brønnøysundregistrene)"},{"source_url":"https://data.brreg.no/enhetsregisteret/api/enheter/921270887/roller","retrieved_at":"2026-10-17T09:43:18Z","content_sha256":"78fb043ee24c871977207864381bcba3378740dbe22b970e40e463e8b4595678","snapshot_path":"snapshots/78/78fb043ee24c871977207864381bcba3378740dbe22b970e40e463e8b4595678.json","source_class":"official_registry","licence":"NLOD 2.0 (Brønnøysundregistrene)"},{"source_url":"https://data.brreg.no/enhetsregisteret/api/underenheter?overordnetEnhet=921270887&size=100","retrieved_at":"2026-10-1